### Get all todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Accept: application/json

### Create todo 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buy groceries",
  "completed": false,
  "date": "2026-10-25T15:30:00Z",
  "color": "blue"
}

### Create todo 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Call the mechanic",
  "completed": false,
  "color": "yellow"
}

### Create todo 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Read Kotlin documentation",
  "completed": true,
  "date": "2026-10-25T16:00:00Z",
  "color": "green"
}

### Filter pending todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos?completed=false
Accept: application/json

### Filter completed todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos?completed=true
Accept: application/json

### Get todo by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### Update todo
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buy groceries and cook dinner",
  "completed": false,
  "color": "red",
  "date": "2026-10-25T18:00:00Z"
}

### Toggle todo status 1
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1/toggle
Accept: application/json

### Toggle todo status 2
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1/toggle
Accept: application/json

### Delete todo by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/2

### Delete completed todos
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/completed

### Get non existent todo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/99999
Accept: application/json

### Update non existent todo
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This task does not exist",
  "completed": true,
  "color": "gray"
}

### Toggle non existent todo
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/99999/toggle
Accept: application/json

### Delete non existent todo
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/99999

### Get todo invalid id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/invalid-id
Accept: application/json

### Filter invalid completed status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos?completed=notABoolean
Accept: application/json

### Create todo invalid date format
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Task with wrong date",
  "completed": false,
  "date": "25-10-2026 15:30"
}

### Delete completed todos when empty
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/completed

### Preflight cors options
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type